  "readme_html": "\n        \n          <p><img src=\"https://ollama.com/assets/library/llama3-chatqa/835859df-86ec-4859-aab8-c5d6b7195b7c\" width=\"320\"/></p>\n\n<p>ChatQA-1.5 is built on top of the Llama-3 base model, and incorporates conversational QA data to enhance its tabular and arithmetic calculation capability.</p>\n\n<p>ChatQA-1.5 has two variants:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Llama3-ChatQA-1.5-8B <code>llama3-chatqa:8b</code></li>\n<li>Llama3-ChatQA-1.5-70B <code>llama3-chatqa:70b</code></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>References</h2>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://chatqa-project.github.io/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Website</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Llama3-ChatQA-1.5-70B\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hugging Face</a></p>\n\n        \n      "
